---
const outcomes = [
  'A clear x-ray of your current financial state',
  'The exact gaps between where you are and your goals',
  'Diagnostic worksheets you keep and reuse',
  'Systems that make progress compound automatically',
  'A short, honest plan for what to fix first',
  'Confidence to make the next money decision alone',
]
---
<section class="border-b border-black/10 py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#FFBD40]">What you walk away with</span>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-bold text-4xl tracking-tight md:text-5xl text-black">
        Two hours in.
        <span class="italic text-[#FFBD40]"> A different relationship with your money.</span>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto mt-12 grid max-w-4xl gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
      {outcomes.map((o) => (
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-black/10 bg-white p-4">
          <span class="mt-0.5 text-[#FFBD40] text-lg">✅</span>
          <span class="text-sm text-black">{o}</span>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <figure class="mx-auto mt-14 max-w-3xl rounded-3xl border border-[#FFBD40]/30 bg-white p-8 text-center md:p-12">
      <div aria-hidden class="font-bold text-5xl leading-none text-[#FFBD40]">"</div>
      <blockquote class="mt-2 font-bold text-2xl leading-snug text-black md:text-3xl">
        For the first time I could actually
        <span class="italic text-[#FFBD40]"> see my finances clearly</span> and knew exactly what to do next.
      </blockquote>
      <figcaption class="mt-4 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-black/40">Past Student · Lagos</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
